I figure it's pretty simple to implement.

Hawaiian shirts are colorful. I propose that rather than having all 
Hawaiian shirts being displayed as royal purple (gnome king, dwarf king, 
queen bee) the color is randomized among various bright colors.

So someone delving the dungeons will stumble upon a bright green Hawaiian 
shirt or a lemon yellow Hawaiian shirt.

Bright colors are fitting and will prevent using armor colors like brown 
and steely blue. Also white wouldn't be a possible color since it's 
reserved for t-shirts, crystal plate mail and aprons.

Heck if t-shirts can have different sayings on them, Hawaiian shirts can be 
different colors and give a little variety to the game.


